Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 20:37:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] FIX CRITICAL: Replace hardcoded demo wallets with dynamic
 user wallet display

- Remove: Hardcoded 'MoonBite Wallet 1/2', 'Trading Wallet' (everyone saw same wallets)
- Add: Dynamic wallet display showing user's actual wallet from localStorage
- Each device now shows its own unique wallet (derived from unique userId)
- Display: wallet name, balance, and address in My Wallets screen
- Function: populateWalletsScreen() retrieves from CustodialWallet.getWallet()

Bug: All machines saw identical demo wallets because they were hardcoded in HTML.
Fix: Now displays the unique wallet for each device/user.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
